{"seq":2,"slug":"block-tables","title":"块表与映射：分页机制的中枢","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/paged-attention-serving/paging/block-tables","wordCount":1421,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"块表与映射-分页机制的中枢\">块表与映射：分页机制的中枢</h1><p>如果说块是分页的原子，那么块表就是让这些原子协同工作的中枢神经。它是一张 per-sequence 的表，把序列眼里连续的逻辑块号，翻译成散落在显存各处的物理块 ID。序列的一生——分配、追加、共享、释放——全都发生在这张表上。理解了块表，你就握住了 PagedAttention 的操作面板。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-块表是什么\">核心概念：块表是什么</h2><p>每个序列有且仅有一张块表，本质是一个数组：下标是逻辑块号（0, 1, 2, …），值是对应的物理块 ID。它扮演的角色和操作系统页表完全一致，见 <a href=\"../foundations/virtual-memory-analogy\">虚拟内存类比</a>。当模型要访问第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token 的 KV 时，引擎先算出它落在哪个逻辑块、块内偏移多少，再查块表得到物理块，最后到显存里定位：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>logical_block</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mi>i</mi><mi>B</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>offset</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>phys</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>block_table</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>logical_block</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{logical\\_block} = \\left\\lfloor \\frac{i}{B} \\right\\rfloor, \\quad \\text{offset} = i \\bmod B, \\quad \\text{phys} = \\text{block\\_table}[\\text{logical\\_block}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">logical_block</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3365em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌋</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">offset</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">phys</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">block_table</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">logical_block</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这张表小得可以忽略——每个逻辑块只需一个整数 ID，一个几千 token 的序列块表也就几百个整数。但它承载的语义极重：正因为序列只通过这张表间接寻址、从不直接持有物理地址，引擎才有权在背后随意腾挪物理块。追加一个 token 的逻辑，用几行就能表达：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def append_token(seq, kv):&#10;    if seq.tokens % BLOCK == 0:          # 上一个块刚好写满&#10;        seq.block_table.append(pool.alloc())  # 才向块池要新块&#10;    phys = seq.block_table[-1]&#10;    write(phys, seq.tokens % BLOCK, kv)  # 写入当前块的下一个槽位&#10;    seq.tokens += 1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> append_token</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(seq, kv):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seq.tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> BLOCK</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 上一个块刚好写满</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        seq.block_table.append(pool.alloc())  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 才向块池要新块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    phys </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seq.block_table[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    write(phys, seq.tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> BLOCK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, kv)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 写入当前块的下一个槽位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    seq.tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[序列请求第 i 个 token 的 KV] --&gt; B[算逻辑块号 i//B]&#10;  B --&gt; C[查块表 block_table]&#10;  C --&gt; D[得到物理块 ID]&#10;  D --&gt; E[显存物理块内偏移 i%B]&#10;  E --&gt; F[定位到 K/V 张量]&#10;  C -.表小到可忽略.-&gt; G[每逻辑块一个整数]\">flowchart TD\n  A[序列请求第 i 个 token 的 KV] --&gt; B[算逻辑块号 i//B]\n  B --&gt; C[查块表 block_table]\n  C --&gt; D[得到物理块 ID]\n  D --&gt; E[显存物理块内偏移 i%B]\n  E --&gt; F[定位到 K/V 张量]\n  C -.表小到可忽略.-&gt; G[每逻辑块一个整数]</pre><h2 id=\"序列的一生-分配-追加-释放\">序列的一生：分配、追加、释放</h2><p>块表最动态的一面，是它随生成过程实时增长。跟踪一个请求的完整生命周期，就能看清整套机制：</p>\n<p><strong>Prefill 阶段</strong>：请求带着 prompt 进来，引擎按 prompt 长度算出需要几个块，从块池一次性取出这些空闲物理块，填入块表，把 prompt 的 KV 算好写进去。</p>\n<p><strong>Decode 阶段</strong>：每生成一个新 token，就往序列尾部追加一个 token 的 KV。多数时候当前最后一个块还没满，直接写进去即可，块表不变；一旦最后一个块写满（每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token 触发一次），引擎才从块池再取一个空闲块、在块表末尾追加一项。这就是「按需分配」——用一个 token 才可能分一个块，绝不预留。</p>\n<p><strong>结束阶段</strong>：请求完成，引擎遍历它的块表，把每个物理块的引用计数减一，计数归零的块回到块池空闲队列，供后来者复用。</p>\n<p>下表汇总每个阶段对块表和块池的动作：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>对块表</th>\n<th>对块池</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Prefill</td>\n<td>请求进入</td>\n<td>一次性填入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil S_{prompt}/B \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span> 项</td>\n<td>批量取出对应空闲块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Decode（块未满）</td>\n<td>生成新 token</td>\n<td>不变，写入末块</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Decode（块写满）</td>\n<td>每满 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token</td>\n<td>末尾追加一项</td>\n<td>取一个空闲块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结束/被抢占</td>\n<td>请求完成或让位</td>\n<td>释放（引用计数减一）</td>\n<td>计数归零则回收</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"引用计数-共享的锚点\">引用计数：共享的锚点</h2><p>块表里的物理块 ID 允许重复出现——不只在一张表内，更在不同序列的表之间。当两个序列的块表指向同一个物理块 ID 时，这个块就被共享了。为了知道一个物理块还被几个序列引用着，每个物理块带一个引用计数 <code>ref_cnt</code>。分配时置 1，被另一序列共享时加 1，序列释放时减 1，归零才真正回收。</p>\n<p>这个引用计数是所有共享机制的公共锚点。写时复制靠它判断「这个块是不是被别人也用着，写之前要不要复制」，见 <a href=\"../sharing/copy-on-write\">写时复制</a>；前缀共享靠它让成千请求安全共用同一份系统提示的块，见 <a href=\"../sharing/prefix-sharing\">前缀共享 (系统提示)</a>。可以说，块表提供「指向哪」，引用计数提供「被谁指」，两者合起来才让共享既灵活又安全。</p>\n<h2 id=\"抢占-块表让-kv-可迁移\">抢占：块表让 KV 可迁移</h2><p>块表还解锁了一个连续分配做不到的能力：抢占。当显存告急、必须给高优先级请求腾地方时，引擎可以暂停某个低优先级序列，把它的物理块整体挪走——要么换出到 CPU 内存（swap），要么干脆丢弃、日后重算（recompute）。两种历史上都存在；vLLM V1 起默认仅以重算实现，缘由见落地篇。因为序列只认逻辑块号，恢复时引擎只要重新分配物理块、重填块表映射，序列就能无缝续跑，它甚至不知道自己被搬过家。</p>\n<p>抢占是连续批处理在显存不足时的安全阀，两种历史策略各有代价，详细对照留到落地篇，见 <a href=\"../practice/paged-attention-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>。这里的要点是：正因为块表把「逻辑」和「物理」解耦，KV 才从一段钉死的连续显存，变成了可随时迁移的活动资产。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>块表是 per-sequence 的数组，下标为逻辑块号、值为物理块 ID，等价于操作系统页表。</li>\n<li>访问第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token 靠 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lfloor i/B \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span> 查表得物理块、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i \\bmod B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 定位块内偏移。</li>\n<li>序列生命周期全在块表上演：prefill 批量填入、decode 满块才追加（按需分配）、结束时按引用计数释放。</li>\n<li>每个物理块的引用计数 <code>ref_cnt</code> 是所有共享机制的公共锚点，记录块被几个序列引用。</li>\n<li>逻辑与物理解耦使 KV 可迁移，从而支持抢占（vLLM V1 起默认以丢弃重算实现）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h3><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"kv-blocks\">KV 块与页</a> — 块表所映射的物理块本身</li>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"non-contiguous-kv\">非连续 KV 存储</a> — kernel 如何按块表读非连续块</li>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"../sharing/copy-on-write\">写时复制</a> — 引用计数如何支撑安全共享</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../kv-cache-optimization/memory/fragmentation-allocation\">KV 缓存优化 · 碎片与分配</a> — 分配器视角的对照</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"块表与映射：分页机制的中枢","id":"块表与映射-分页机制的中枢"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：块表是什么","id":"核心概念-块表是什么"},{"level":2,"text":"序列的一生：分配、追加、释放","id":"序列的一生-分配-追加-释放"},{"level":2,"text":"引用计数：共享的锚点","id":"引用计数-共享的锚点"},{"level":2,"text":"抢占：块表让 KV 可迁移","id":"抢占-块表让-kv-可迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"KV 块与页：分页的最小单元","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/paged-attention-serving/paging/kv-blocks"},"next":{"title":"非连续 KV 存储：kernel 如何在碎片上算注意力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/paged-attention-serving/paging/non-contiguous-kv"}}